ars, cjk_chars,\n                text_quality, text}\ntext_quality: \"clean\" when cjk_chars >= 50, else \"low_text_or_garbled\"\n(meaning: no reliable text layer; needs OCR, which this program does not do).\n\nExit codes: 0 = success (including zero profiles when no PDF found);\n2 = usage error, missing path, or unreadable/invalid PDF (stderr names the file).\nPaths must not overlap; duplicate paths are skipped by resolved path.\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport hashlib\nimport json\nimport logging\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nimport pypdf\n\n===\n  146 /workspace/inputs/reusable/skill_1/scripts/extract_resumes.py\n  130 /workspace/inputs/reusable/skill_2/scripts/extract_resumes.py\n  214 /workspace/inputs/reusable/skill_2/scripts/extract_texts.py\n  490 total"}], "details": {"status": "completed", "exitCode": 0, "exitSignal": null, "exitReason": "exit", "durationMs": 38, "aggregated": "#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"批量简历PDF文本提取（JD-简历筛选路线 s2）。\n\n用法:\n  python extract_resumes.py <简历目录或单个.pdf>... --out <输出目录>\n\n每个输入是目录（非递归扫描 *.pdf，按文件名排序）或单个 .pdf。要求PDF含可提取\n文本层；扫描图/乱码字体的简历会被标记为 low_text_or_garbled（不在此程序内OCR）。\n\n输出（写入 --out 目录）:\n  index.json      : {schema, inputs[], profiles[]}\n                    profiles[] 每份简历一条摘要: {file_name, source_path, sha256,\n                    pages, text_chars, cjk_chars, text_quality, text_file}\n                    只含元数据与质量标记，不含正文——正文按需读 texts/ 下对应文件，\n                    避免整批全文进入上下文。\n  texts/<名>.txt  : 每份简历的完整提取文本（同目录同名自动加序号，不覆盖）。\n\ntext_quality: cjk_chars >= 50 为 \"clean\"，否则 \"low_text_or_garbled\"\n（含义：无可靠文本层，需OCR兜底，本程序不做OCR）。\n\n退出码: 0 = 成功（含0份PDF）；2 = 用法错误、路径不存在或PDF不可读（stderr指名文件）。\n路径不重叠；重复输入按解析路径去重。\n\"\"\"\nimport argparse\nimport hashlib\nimport json\nimport logging\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nimport pypdf\n\nlogging.getLogger(\"pypdf\").setLevel(logging.ERROR)\n\n\ndef sha256_file(path: Path) -> str:\n    h = hashlib.sha256()\n    with open(path, \"rb\") as f:\n        for chunk in iter(lambda: f